# Windows scripts keep Windows line endings, also in GitHub's "Download ZIP" (cmd.exe misreads some LF-only batch files).
* text=auto
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pptx binary
*.zip binary
